---
config:
  theme: default
  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: '#ffcc00'
    primaryTextColor: '#003366'
    lineColor: '#008800'
    secondaryColor: '#99ccff'
    tertiaryColor: '#ffe6f0'
    background: '#fff2cc'
    mainBkg: '#d9ead3'
description: >-
  baseline/themes/default.mmd, the representative state diagram, under base-colour overrides in
  the default theme (#1035, D656, D668): the transitions and their label borders keep #333333,
  the composite body #ffffff and its title strip #ececff, as in v12; the states take the
  mainBkg override, and the start dot and the arrowheads the lineColor override
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> check : request
  state check <<choice>>
  check --> Working : valid
  check --> Idle : invalid
  state Working {
    [*] --> Reading
    Reading --> Writing
    --
    [*] --> Logging
  }
  Working --> Done
  note right of Done : All done
  classDef hot fill:#f96,stroke:#333
  class Done hot
  Done --> [*]
